[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7080.629, "timestamp": "01:58:00", "text": "别以为我不认为任何人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7082.629, "timestamp": "01:58:02", "text": "能够管理所有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7089.79, "timestamp": "01:58:09", "text": "我们不在一起"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7093.83, "timestamp": "01:58:13", "text": "我知道，而且我觉得我精疲力竭了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7098.39, "timestamp": "01:58:18", "text": "实际上，这一切都源于一次。呃，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7100.07, "timestamp": "01:58:20", "text": "不知道。我不记得是什么时候了。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7104.629, "timestamp": "01:58:24", "text": "就在那一天，你会像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7107.99, "timestamp": "01:58:27", "text": "在我玩游戏之后，我的游戏电脑突然坏掉了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7110.79, "timestamp": "01:58:30", "text": "那款逼真的射击游戏。我觉得是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7114.95, "timestamp": "01:58:34", "text": "被叫去准备，或者不是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7118.149, "timestamp": "01:58:38", "text": "忘了它就是这样，真的真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7121.51, "timestamp": "01:58:41", "text": "逼真的射击游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7125.91, "timestamp": "01:58:45", "text": "你的电脑因此坏掉了。我感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7128.31, "timestamp": "01:58:48", "text": "这对PC来说负担太重了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7131.35, "timestamp": "01:58:51", "text": "既要能处理，又要像你知道它是什么一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7134.229, "timestamp": "01:58:54", "text": "六年过去了，最终还是发生了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7137.99, "timestamp": "01:58:57", "text": "生命维持系统，所以那件事还算公平。"}]